## Hook Analysis
<!-- HOOK_START -->
**Hook Type:** Contrarian
**Analysis:** The title leads with Andrew Ng's provocative claim that 'Prompting will be dead in 6 months,' which directly contradicts the prevailing focus on prompt engineering in the AI community. This contrarian position is designed to challenge viewers' existing assumptions and draw them in to understand what's replacing it.
