## Description

Google Brain founder, Andrew Ng:   "Prompting will be dead in 6 months. Loops and Graphs are what's replacing it."  In 1 hours at Stanford he shows what the best engineers build instead, and how you start building it today.  Everything a $500 course sells you is in the first 10 https://t.co/8SbhOiZWdx

